. Full-load hardware validation, thermal checks, EMI and PoE power-demotion handling remain.\nBuck values: TI LMR33620 Table 9-2, 400 kHz. Verify effective MLCC capacitance under DC bias and hot inductor saturation.\nKeep 24 V switching transients below the regulators 36 V operating limit. No connector is joined to the existing board nets.\nThe current Sheet_3 Ethernet transformer / Bob Smith termination must be revised for 4-pair PoE++ before connection." (at 25 343 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "16234039-c1bc-488e-9182-ac432d3a1624")))